Emerald 3DS changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: Korean naming screen
Applies after 0059-korean-name-lengths.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

Korean build only (GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_KOREAN): the keyboard of the Korean
ROM, ten columns with the Hangul jamo (2-beolsik) on the letters page and
digits and Latin letters on the other two, and syllable composition as the
jamo are typed: double vowels and finals, a final moving on to the next
syllable before a vowel, and Back taking one jamo off. Syllables are the 2350
of KS X 1001 (include/hangul_ks.h). The entry box shows one character per
8-pixel slot, Hangul in the narrow font, and a name holds half as many slots
as the template's bytes; the cursor starts 11 pixels further left, under the
Korean keys.

